# Production secret (set once, never rotate):
#   npx wrangler pages secret put VOTE_SALT --project-name whale-vote
#
# VOTE_SALT derives voter IDs, network dedup keys and rate-limit buckets.
# Rotating it invalidates existing cookies and re-opens the poll.
#
# No Turnstile, CAPTCHA or login secrets are used by this project.
VOTE_SALT=
